          "fontSize": 10,
          "verticalAlignment": "middle",
          "wordWrap": "autoWrap"
        },
        "value": "The current status of the DPP as a digital resource"
      },
      {
        "cellStyles": {
          "fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "verticalAlignment": "middle",
          "wordWrap": "autoWrap"
        },
        "value": "The status of the DPP instance as digital resource.\nExample: \"active\", \"inactive\", \"archived\", \"marked-for-deletion\"，\"invalid\""
      },
      {
        "cellStyles": {
          "fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "horizontalAlignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "middle",
          "wordWrap": "autoWrap"
        },
        "value": "The options for DPP status should be defined as\n- active: current version of the battery passport\n- archived: past version of the battery passport, archived after an update.\n- inactive: A battery passport linked to a new battery passport, which has a different DPP status than 'inactive', after reuse, repurposing, remanufacturing.\n- marked-for-deletion: a battery passport that has been marked for deletion after recycling or export of the battery\n- invalid: a battery passport that has been marked as invalid, e.g. by market surveillance"
      },
      {
